36
00:01:13,850 --> 00:01:20,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">dakara haruka kanata</font></b></font></font></font>

37
00:01:13,850 --> 00:01:20,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">and so we'll go far off into the distance</font></b></font></font></font>

38
00:01:47,620 --> 00:01:48,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If "Heaven" does not exist,</font>

39
00:01:48,540 --> 00:01:50,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">enrich your knowledge,
and prepare for the chance.</font>

40
00:01:50,340 --> 00:01:51,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If "Earth" does not exist,</font>

41
00:01:51,290 --> 00:01:52,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">run the fields in search
of an advantage.</font>

42
00:01:53,340 --> 00:01:57,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Open the series of Heaven and Earth,
and the perilous way shall be redressed...</font>

43
00:01:57,180 --> 00:02:01,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is namely the secret of
"the one that guides..."</font>

44
00:02:02,510 --> 00:02:03,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's that?</font>

45
00:02:04,140 --> 00:02:06,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It probably has to do with the scroll.</font>

46
00:02:07,310 --> 00:02:11,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I think this means we're supposed
to open the Heaven & Earth scroll.</font>

47
00:02:24,540 --> 00:02:26,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay then, I'm going to open it.</font>

48
00:02:38,300 --> 00:02:40,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? What's this?</font>

49
00:02:41,300 --> 00:02:42,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A man...?</font>

50
00:02:42,220 --> 00:02:43,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A person...?</font>

51
00:02:47,930 --> 00:02:50,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is... a Summoning Jutsu!</font>

52
00:02:50,480 --> 00:02:53,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto! Sakura!
Let go of the scroll!</font>

53
00:02:53,520 --> 00:02:54,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh...</font>

54
00:03:06,040 --> 00:03:07,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wha...?!</font>

55
00:03:07,200 --> 00:03:09,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Y-You...</font>

56
00:03:18,010 --> 00:03:19,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hi!</font>

57
00:03:20,630 --> 00:03:22,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's been a long time.</font>

58
00:03:23,510 --> 00:03:30,270
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">The Second Exam</font>

59
00:03:23,510 --> 00:03:30,270
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Completed!</font>

60
00:03:23,510 --> 00:03:30,270
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">All of Them Are Here,</font>

61
00:03:23,510 --> 00:03:30,270
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">The Rookie Nine!</font>

62
00:03:36,110 --> 00:03:37,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What's going on?</font>

63
00:03:38,230 --> 00:03:41,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It appears you guys have had
a rough time of it.</font>

64
00:03:41,700 --> 00:03:42,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

65
00:03:43,200 --> 00:03:46,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why are you appearing with
a Summoning?</font>

66
00:03:47,080 --> 00:03:49,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At the end of this second exam,</font>

67
00:03:49,120 --> 00:03:53,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">we Chunin are to
welcome the test-takers.</font>

68
00:03:53,710 --> 00:03:55,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I just happened to be given</font>

69
00:03:55,500 --> 00:03:58,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the important task of being
the messenger for you guys.</font>

70
00:03:59,460 --> 00:04:00,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Messenger...?!</font>

71
00:04:05,090 --> 00:04:07,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just in time.</font>

72
00:04:10,180 --> 00:04:11,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Everyone...</font>

73
00:04:12,390 --> 00:04:15,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Congratulations on surviving
the second exam.</font>

74
00:04:17,690 --> 00:04:19,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To celebrate your passing,</font>

75
00:04:19,320 --> 00:04:22,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'd like to treat you to
some Ichiraku ramen, but...</font>

76
00:04:22,860 --> 00:04:25,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh... Cool!</font>

77
00:04:25,360 --> 00:04:26,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uh-oh...</font>

78
00:04:26,820 --> 00:04:27,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">H-Hey, Naruto!</font>

79
00:04:28,280 --> 00:04:30,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Listen to the end...
— Cool! Cool!</font>

80
00:04:30,750 --> 00:04:33,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ramen! Ramen!</font>

81
00:04:34,620 --> 00:04:37,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've done great job!
I'm the greatest!</font>

82
00:04:37,500 --> 00:04:40,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I so want to eat ramen!</font>

83
00:04:41,760 --> 00:04:43,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's got so much energy.</font>

84
00:04:44,470 --> 00:04:45,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yay!</font>

85
00:04:45,510 --> 00:04:46,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shut up!</font>

86
00:04:47,180 --> 00:04:52,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Man, that scatterbrained part
of you is the same as always, eh.</font>

87
00:04:54,390 --> 00:04:55,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see.</font>

88
00:04:55,810 --> 00:04:56,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

89
00:04:57,150 --> 00:05:00,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If we had looked at the scroll
in the middle of the exam,</font>

90
00:05:00,820 --> 00:05:04,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">what were you going to do, Iruka-sensei?</font>

91
00:05:08,160 --> 00:05:11,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke, you're a sharp one,
as usual.</font>

92
00:05:14,210 --> 00:05:15,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You guessed right.</font>

93
00:05:16,290 --> 00:05:22,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The rules of this exam were to test
your conclusive mission execution ability.</font>

94
00:05:22,800 --> 00:05:24,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To put it simply,</font>

95
00:05:24,260 --> 00:05:29,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">in the case of the scrolls being opened
contrary to the rules...</font>

96
00:05:29,470 --> 00:05:31,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In the case of them being opened...?</font>

97
00:05:35,980 --> 00:05:41,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was ordered to knock unconscious
the test-takers in front of me</font>

98
00:05:41,150 --> 00:05:43,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">until the end of the exam.</font>

99
00:05:45,440 --> 00:05:47,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Good thing you didn't open the scroll.</font>

100
00:05:50,120 --> 00:05:52,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kabuto-san, thank you!</font>

101
00:05:53,290 --> 00:05:54,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Phew!</font>

102
00:05:54,660 --> 00:05:57,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That was seriously close...</font>

103
00:05:59,960 --> 00:06:01,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh yeah, Sensei!</font>

104
00:06:01,460 --> 00:06:02,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

105
00:06:02,710 --> 00:06:05,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">By the way,
what're the letters on that wall?</font>

106
00:06:05,260 --> 00:06:07,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They're kind of vermiculated and</font>

107
00:06:07,800 --> 00:06:10,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">we don't understand
their meaning at all.</font>

108
00:06:11,550 --> 00:06:13,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Never mind, never mind!</font>

109
00:06:13,510 --> 00:06:15,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We passed!</font>

110
00:06:15,770 --> 00:06:21,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No... explaining that is
one more of my duties.</font>

111
00:06:21,690 --> 00:06:23,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What, really?</font>

112
00:06:23,980 --> 00:06:26,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm saying that's right.</font>

113
00:06:27,650 --> 00:06:28,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Give it a read.</font>

114
00:06:29,820 --> 00:06:33,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">These are Chunin instructions
Hokage-sama recorded.</font>

115
00:06:34,040 --> 00:06:35,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Instructions?!</font>

116
00:06:35,750 --> 00:06:36,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right!</font>

117
00:06:36,790 --> 00:06:40,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Heaven in this text
refers to the human head.</font>

118
00:06:41,000 --> 00:06:43,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Earth refers to the human body.</font>

119
00:06:44,090 --> 00:06:45,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No kidding...</font>

120
00:06:45,460 --> 00:06:46,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If "Heaven" does not exist,</font>

121
00:06:46,920 --> 00:06:49,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">enrich your knowledge,
and prepare for the chance.</font>

122
00:06:50,010 --> 00:06:51,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In other words...</font>

123
00:06:52,010 --> 00:06:55,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If your weaknesses are
inside your head, Naruto...</font>

124
00:06:55,560 --> 00:06:58,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">learn various logics in
preparing for your missions.</font>

125
00:06:59,020 --> 00:07:01,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hah! So meddlesome!</font>

126
00:07:02,610 --> 00:07:04,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If "Earth" does not exist,</font>

127
00:07:04,730 --> 00:07:07,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">run through the fields
in search of an advantage.</font>

128
00:07:07,530 --> 00:07:10,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If your weaknesses are in
your physical strength, Sakura,</font>

129
00:07:10,610 --> 00:07:16,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it means you must not
slack off on your daily training.</font>

130
00:07:18,250 --> 00:07:21,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And if you combine both
Heaven and Earth...</font>

131
00:07:22,210 --> 00:07:24,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Any perilous mission is the right way...</font>

132
00:07:24,960 --> 00:07:25,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In other words...</font>

133
00:07:25,960 --> 00:07:30,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">what can also be called a rule
of might and become a safe mission.</font>

134
00:07:30,720 --> 00:07:33,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then, what about
the spot with the missing letter?</font>

135
00:07:34,640 --> 00:07:37,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The letter refers to Chunin.</font>

136
00:07:37,970 --> 00:07:43,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The one letter for "person" that
was in the scroll from earlier goes there.</font>

137
00:07:44,020 --> 00:07:45,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">These five days of survival
were to test</font>

138
00:07:45,940 --> 00:07:49,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the test-takers' fundamental
abilities as Chunin.</font>

139
00:07:50,570 --> 00:07:53,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And you guys cleared it in fine style.</font>

140
00:07:54,410 --> 00:07:56,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Chunin is of unit-leader class.</font>

141
00:07:56,530 --> 00:07:58,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They have the responsibility
of leading a team.</font>

142
00:07:59,370 --> 00:08:02,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Be more deeply aware of
the necessity of physical strength...</font>

143
00:08:02,620 --> 00:08:06,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and knowledge in missions!</font>

144
00:08:07,250 --> 00:08:10,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I want you to take on
the next step,</font>

145
00:08:10,510 --> 00:08:12,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">never forgetting these
Chunin instructions.</font>

146
00:08:13,880 --> 00:08:17,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That is all of the messenger task
I was given.</font>

147
00:08:20,980 --> 00:08:22,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Got it!</font>

148
00:08:31,690 --> 00:08:32,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

149
00:08:36,160 --> 00:08:41,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But, as for the final third exam,
don't push it too far.</font>

150
00:08:42,330 --> 00:08:43,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Especially you, Naruto.</font>

151
00:08:43,960 --> 00:08:45,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— You're the biggest worry...
— Iruka-sensei.</font>

152
00:08:46,250 --> 00:08:48,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">From when I received the
Leaf headband,</font>

153
00:08:48,880 --> 00:08:52,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was no longer
an Academy student, you know?!</font>

154
00:08:52,590 --> 00:08:54,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's nothing to worry about!</font>

155
00:08:55,430 --> 00:09:00,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Also, this is the proof you
gave me that I'm full-fledged, right?!</font>

156
00:09:00,310 --> 00:09:03,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That I'm scatterbrained may
not have changed,</font>

157
00:09:03,640 --> 00:09:05,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but I'm not a kid anymore!</font>

158
00:09:08,440 --> 00:09:09,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm now...</font>

159
00:09:12,990 --> 00:09:14,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A Ninja!</font>

160
00:09:23,540 --> 00:09:24,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see.</font>

161
00:09:24,500 --> 00:09:26,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry, Naruto.</font>

162
00:09:30,670 --> 00:09:33,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I know their strength the best.</font>

163
00:09:34,010 --> 00:09:35,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If it's futile anyway,</font>

164
00:09:35,420 --> 00:09:37,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I would like to give them
the final word personally.</font>

165
00:09:37,430 --> 00:09:41,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you're that hung up on it,
I can leave that team to you.</font>

166
00:09:43,140 --> 00:09:46,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To think you'd play the devil's advocate...</font>

167
00:09:47,140 --> 00:09:48,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thank you very much.</font>

168
00:09:49,270 --> 00:09:52,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But, they're Kakashi's, right?</font>

169
00:09:53,230 --> 00:09:55,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If he's the one who
recommended them,</font>

170
00:09:55,490 --> 00:09:58,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I thought I could count on them.</font>

171
00:10:02,830 --> 00:10:04,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stay out of it!</font>

172
00:10:04,500 --> 00:10:10,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They're not your students anymore.
They're my subordinates now.</font>

173
00:10:16,260 --> 00:10:19,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The one who might truly understand</font>

174
00:10:21,680 --> 00:10:25,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the strength of these kids.
might be you, Kakashi-san.</font>

175
00:10:34,190 --> 00:10:35,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How is it?</font>

176
00:10:35,690 --> 00:10:37,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Does the Curse Mark still hurt?</font>

177
00:10:38,070 --> 00:10:39,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No.</font>

178
00:10:39,110 --> 00:10:41,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thanks to you,
it's gotten quite a bit better.</font>

179
00:10:42,370 --> 00:10:48,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Anyway, Orochimaru is one
of those three legendary Leaf Ninja, right?</font>

180
00:10:48,540 --> 00:10:50,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's a S-rank bingo book
rouge Shinobi</font>

181
00:10:50,920 --> 00:10:53,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">who even the ANBU couldn't touch, right?</font>

182
00:10:54,750 --> 00:10:56,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I heard that he'd already died, but...</font>

183
00:10:57,010 --> 00:11:00,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why'd he come to this village now...?</font>

184
00:11:09,730 --> 00:11:11,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's a kid I want, you see.</font>

185
00:11:14,020 --> 00:11:17,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This kid inherits the abilities
of the Uchiha clan, so...</font>

186
00:11:22,910 --> 00:11:23,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's...</font>

187
00:11:24,740 --> 00:11:26,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's probably Sasuke, right?</font>

188
00:11:26,490 --> 00:11:27,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?!</font>

189
00:11:28,160 --> 00:11:29,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Anko-sama!</font>

190
00:11:30,210 --> 00:11:33,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Twenty-one second exam
finishers have been confirmed.</font>

191
00:11:34,130 --> 00:11:36,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As for the third exam, according
to the regulations of the Chunin Exams,</font>

192
00:11:36,920 --> 00:11:39,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">preliminaries are planned for
the first time in five years.</font>

193
00:11:39,920 --> 00:11:41,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The second exam is over.</font>

194
00:11:50,390 --> 00:11:53,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For the time being,
continue the exams as is,</font>

195
00:11:53,810 --> 00:11:57,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but while keeping
an eye on his movements.</font>

196
00:11:57,570 --> 00:11:58,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes...</font>

197
00:12:11,870 --> 00:12:15,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">First off, congratulations on
finishing the second exam.</font>

198
00:12:17,340 --> 00:12:20,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There were seventy-eight
test-takers for the second exam.</font>

199
00:12:20,630 --> 00:12:23,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To think twenty-one have
made it this far.</font>

200
00:12:23,840 --> 00:12:28,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I said to make it less than half,
but I'd really thought about single digits.</font>

201
00:12:41,740 --> 00:12:43,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm hungry!</font>

202
00:12:43,320 --> 00:12:45,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There are still this many remaining?</font>

203
00:12:45,860 --> 00:12:47,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is such a major pain.</font>

204
00:12:49,620 --> 00:12:51,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun and the others have passed, too.</font>

205
00:12:52,450 --> 00:12:53,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Of course...</font>

206
00:12:58,630 --> 00:13:00,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We went to that much trouble
to save them...</font>

207
00:13:00,840 --> 00:13:03,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It'd all be for naught if they didn't pass.</font>

208
00:13:07,260 --> 00:13:09,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your team didn't do too bad.</font>

209
00:13:10,760 --> 00:13:12,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I guess they were lucky.</font>

210
00:13:13,230 --> 00:13:17,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But as long as my team is around,
they can't go any higher.</font>

211
00:13:17,560 --> 00:13:20,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">After all, whether you
like it or not,</font>

212
00:13:20,110 --> 00:13:22,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">ability talks at the next barrier.</font>

213
00:13:22,320 --> 00:13:24,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, adolescence can sometimes
be bittersweet and</font>

214
00:13:25,030 --> 00:13:27,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">can sometimes be harsh, Kakashi...</font>

215
00:13:28,870 --> 00:13:30,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Did you say something?</font>

216
00:13:30,240 --> 00:13:35,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh my God!</font>

217
00:13:37,750 --> 00:13:40,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Not bad, my rival Kakashi.</font>

218
00:13:40,590 --> 00:13:44,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But that part of you is so hip...
which is what annoys me!</font>

219
00:13:45,340 --> 00:13:48,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So that's Guy-sensei's eternal rival, eh?</font>

220
00:13:49,180 --> 00:13:52,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Guy-sensei totally loses visually...</font>

221
00:13:52,560 --> 00:13:56,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Guy-sensei is the hippest
of all the teachers!</font>

222
00:13:56,690 --> 00:13:57,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He shines!</font>

223
00:13:57,810 --> 00:13:58,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay!</font>

224
00:13:59,360 --> 00:14:03,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please watch, Guy-sensei!
I'll shine, too!</font>

225
00:14:16,790 --> 00:14:23,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't ever want to see
tears of those dear to me again.</font>

226
00:14:24,800 --> 00:14:25,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So...</font>

227
00:14:26,970 --> 00:14:29,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't ever lose again!</font>

228
00:14:29,430 --> 00:14:30,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Guy-sensei.</font>

229
00:14:31,220 --> 00:14:33,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sure enough, the outstanding candidates
have gathered.</font>

230
00:14:37,810 --> 00:14:39,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uchiha Sasuke, eh?</font>

231
00:14:43,400 --> 00:14:46,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll get you back for my arms,
Uchiha Sasuke...</font>

232
00:14:47,690 --> 00:14:48,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At any cost.</font>

233
00:15:00,790 --> 00:15:04,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To think a mere seven teams
are left of the twenty-six...</font>

234
00:15:07,340 --> 00:15:10,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sure enough, Gaara is unhurt.</font>

235
00:15:13,800 --> 00:15:15,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Akamaru's acting strange...</font>

236
00:15:21,060 --> 00:15:22,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those Sand Village guys...</font>

237
00:15:25,230 --> 00:15:27,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto-kun passed, too.</font>

238
00:15:28,400 --> 00:15:29,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thank goodness...</font>

239
00:15:30,570 --> 00:15:33,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What, all the Leaf Village
rookies are here.</font>

240
00:15:33,620 --> 00:15:35,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! Hey!</font>

241
00:15:35,450 --> 00:15:39,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Old man Hokage and Iruka-sensei and
even Intense-Brow are here.</font>

242
00:15:39,580 --> 00:15:41,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It feels like everyone's assembled.</font>

243
00:15:42,330 --> 00:15:45,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Humph... I don't have a very good feeling.</font>

244
00:15:49,340 --> 00:15:51,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To think this many are left...</font>

245
00:15:52,090 --> 00:15:55,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Moreover, of those left, almost all are rookies...</font>

246
00:15:55,970 --> 00:15:59,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So that's why they fought
in recommending them.</font>

247
00:16:00,230 --> 00:16:03,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now then, we will now have
the explanation of the third exam</font>

248
00:16:03,190 --> 00:16:04,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">from Hokage-sama.</font>

249
00:16:04,690 --> 00:16:06,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Listen carefully, everybody!</font>

250
00:16:07,690 --> 00:16:09,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now then, if you will,
Hokage-sama.</font>

251
00:16:10,780 --> 00:16:11,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right.</font>

252
00:16:18,490 --> 00:16:23,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Before the explanation of
the third exam that we will start from now,</font>

253
00:16:23,710 --> 00:16:28,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have just one thing I want
to tell everyone flat out.</font>

254
00:16:30,210 --> 00:16:33,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">About the true purpose of these exams.</font>

255
00:16:33,880 --> 00:16:35,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">True purpose...?!</font>

256
00:16:35,840 --> 00:16:40,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why do allied nations conduct
the exams on a conjoint basis?</font>

257
00:16:41,930 --> 00:16:42,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

258
00:16:43,350 --> 00:16:48,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Raising the levels of the Shinobi
and friendship among allied nations.</font>

259
00:16:48,360 --> 00:16:52,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It won't do to have the wrong idea
of the true meaning of that statement.</font>

260
00:16:52,280 --> 00:16:54,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">These exams are so to speak...</font>

261
00:16:54,740 --> 00:16:55,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So to speak...?</font>

262
00:17:04,960 --> 00:17:08,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A microcosm of battle
between allied nations.</font>

263
00:17:10,000 --> 00:17:11,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What does that mean?</font>

264
00:17:12,380 --> 00:17:14,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If we look back on history,</font>

265
00:17:14,260 --> 00:17:17,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the allied nations of today were
once neighboring nations</font>

266
00:17:17,180 --> 00:17:21,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that continued to vie with
each other and battle for power.</font>

267
00:17:22,430 --> 00:17:27,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In order to avoid a futile crushing
of each others' military strength,</font>

268
00:17:27,810 --> 00:17:30,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">those nations mutually selected
a place to battle.</font>

269
00:17:30,820 --> 00:17:36,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And that was how the
Chunin Exams originally began.</font>

270
00:17:40,030 --> 00:17:43,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-Why do we have
to do such a thing?</font>

271
00:17:44,000 --> 00:17:46,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're not doing this to
select Chunin?!</font>

272
00:17:47,040 --> 00:17:53,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There is no question that these exams
are to select Shinobi</font>

273
00:17:53,420 --> 00:17:55,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">worthy of becoming Chunin.</font>

274
00:17:57,130 --> 00:17:58,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But on the other hand,</font>

275
00:17:58,840 --> 00:18:01,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">these exams also provide a venue</font>

276
00:18:01,310 --> 00:18:06,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">for Shinobi who carry their nation's pride
on their backs to fight for their lives!</font>

277
00:18:06,810 --> 00:18:08,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nation's pride...?</font>

278
00:18:09,400 --> 00:18:13,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Many feudal lords and those of
prominence from many nations</font>

279
00:18:13,690 --> 00:18:19,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">who request Shinobi for work
are invited to this third exam as guests.</font>

280
00:18:20,820 --> 00:18:24,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And, the feudal lords and
Head Shinobi of each Village</font>

281
00:18:24,160 --> 00:18:28,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">of the nations will watch your battles.</font>

282
00:18:29,370 --> 00:18:31,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If the gap in national power
becomes unbridgeable,</font>

283
00:18:31,500 --> 00:18:34,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the strong nations are inundated
with job requests.</font>

284
00:18:35,170 --> 00:18:39,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The requests of nations deemed
weak, on the other hand, decline.</font>

285
00:18:39,930 --> 00:18:41,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And therewithal,</font>

286
00:18:41,220 --> 00:18:47,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">we can exert pressure upon
each neighboring nation...</font>

287
00:18:47,890 --> 00:18:52,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That is to say, just how much military
strength our Village is developing and has.</font>

288
00:18:52,860 --> 00:18:56,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even so, why is it necessary for
us to fight for our lives?!</font>

289
00:18:58,150 --> 00:19:00,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The nation's strength is
the Village's strength.</font>

290
00:19:00,610 --> 00:19:03,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Village's strength is
the Shinobi's strength.</font>

291
00:19:03,830 --> 00:19:09,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And the true strength of the Shinobi
is created only in a fight for one's life!</font>

292
00:19:10,670 --> 00:19:15,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This exam is a place to see
the strength of home country Shinobi,</font>

293
00:19:15,590 --> 00:19:17,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and a place to display this as well.</font>

294
00:19:18,010 --> 00:19:21,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It is because it's an exam where
you truly fight for your life</font>

295
00:19:21,640 --> 00:19:22,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that this has meaning.</font>

296
00:19:22,840 --> 00:19:26,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's for this very reason that
your forerunners fought in this exam,</font>

297
